{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-efc4e3585d50", "start_time": "2026-09-21T21:36:28.530Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 2, "timestamp": "2026-09-21T21:36:37.917Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 14310, "tokens_out": 307, "latency": 0.2653, "finish_reason": "end_turn"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "Summarise the latest adjuster correspondence on TM-2026-0031 and note any actions for me.", "prompt_hash": "sha256:1e71e3db532fd37c80586d49b6d176f6768cd9003544b41878714e4a703505fe", "response_text": "Based on the case file for TM-2026-0031, here's a summary of the adjuster correspondence and actions:\n\n**Latest Adjuster Correspondence Summary:**\n\nThe adjuster's report (AA/26/4471) was received on 14 May 2026 and established that the escape of water was caused by a failed push fit connector installed during a 2023 bathroom refit. This was classified as a sudden failure (not gradual deterioration), so cover responds under the escape of water peril.\n\n**Key Actions Completed:**\n\n- Reserve increased from £4,800 to £21,700 on receipt of the adjuster's report (approved by team leader)\n- Redwell Restoration instructed for drying and reinstatement (19 May)\n- Policyholder's replacement kitchen units confirmed as acceptable match (3 June)\n- Redwell invoice (RRS-2026-3388, £18,144.48) authorised and paid (19 June)\n- Subrogation against the 2023 refit contractor considered but not pursued due to the firm being dissolved in 2024\n\n**Current Status:**\n\nThe claim is now at the reinstatement stage with drying completed and verified. The reserve stands at £21,700 with £18,144 paid to date. No further actions appear outstanding from the adjuster correspondence.", "response_hash": "sha256:b6b9c2b413082bd39ba29852eff623e7337f4ea6cc52f9a55a9bd1b499f1606e", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
